<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Emisphere started.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Emisphere started.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-05-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Goldman Sachs said analyst Prem Lachman on Thursday started coverage of Emisphere Technologies Inc by adding it to his recommended list.</p>
<p>Emisphere shares were up 5/8 to 20-1/2 in early trading.</p>
</text>
